      "revision": 1330075328,
      "text": "Vitex doniana is a tree native to the Afrotropics. Its fruits are one of several fruits called black plums. This tree is often grown for its fruits."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Vitex doniana",
